## Summary Table: End-Loop Flow

| Step | Location | Action | Output |
|------|----------|--------|--------|
| 1 | Agent code | Call `kspec ralph end-loop --reason "X"` | Bash command in stream |
| 2 | ralph.ts:1569 | Pattern match bash command | Sets `endLoopRequested = true` |
| 3 | ralph.ts:1572-1577 | Read marker, log reason | Console: "End-loop signal received (X)" |
| 4 | ralph.ts:1724-1728 | Check flag at iteration end | Sets `exitReason = "end_loop_signal"` |
| 5 | ralph.ts:1320 (loop) | Loop breaks | Exits iteration for loop |
| 6 | ralph.ts:1805-1869 | Spawn wrap-up agent | Final cleanup and context capture |
| 7 | ralph.ts:1796-1800 | Finally block | Clears both marker files |

